    </tr>
  </table>
</aside>

<%= markdown(<<~MARKDOWN)
  ## Security upgrade

  The technical foundation was gradually falling further behind current
  security patches, with no one actively tracking it. Substance Lab
  presented a business case to management and carried out the upgrade
  to supported versions as a planned, controlled process &mdash; rather
  than waiting until an urgent upgrade became necessary under far more
  pressure.
MARKDOWN
%>

<%= render Quote.new(author: "Mads Nørgaard, CFO, Bomae", additional_classes: ["pull-left"]) do %>
  <p>
    Substance Lab stepped in on very short notice, when Bomae lost a key
    employee, and helped us ensure continuity around our portal. They
    are sharp, quick to get up to speed on the issues at hand, and make
    well-reasoned arguments for the solution they consider best.
  </p>
<% end %>

<%= markdown(<<~MARKDOWN)
  ## One shared source of truth for contracts

  Contract previews and the final, signed contract were generated by two
  separate code paths, which could drift apart from each other. In a few
  cases, that created mismatches between what the salesperson showed the
  customer and what the customer ended up signing. Substance Lab merged
  both into one shared data and logic layer, so the preview and the
  final result can never disagree.

  ## Automated confirmation

  One workflow required a manual "OK" in a popup, even though there was
  only ever one valid outcome for that step. Substance Lab automated
  the decision and removed the click from the workflow, so the result is
  the same every time &mdash; without an extra action.
MARKDOWN
%>

